<title>USA: Swift pork plant in Minnesota closed on Monday.</title>
<headline>Swift pork plant in Minnesota closed on Monday.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>ConAgra Inc subsidiary Swift and Co's pork plant in Worthington, Minn. will be closed on Monday for a floating holiday, a company spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>((-Nigel Hunt 312-408 8720))</p>
